# HP50g launch through the original UI and ARMToolbox.
# Copy HPCLANG.HP from SD to HOME, recall the native object from File Manager,
# return to the stack with HALT, then follow the hardware-verified library menu:
# RS+LIB exposes ARMTo on F1, and ARMTo exposes PrRUN on F1.
# The install phase leaves Stock in RPN. Put two dedicated numeric witnesses
# below the later recalled launcher; the M7.3 mutation witness consumes only them.
2000 tap two
2400 tap enter
2800 tap two
3200 tap enter
4000 chord lshift files
6200 capture files
6500 tap up
6800 tap f6
8500 capture sd
8900 tap enter
9200 tap down
9600 capture sd-payload
10000 tap f2
11200 capture copy-destination
11500 tap down
11800 tap f6
13600 capture copy-result
14100 tap f4
15400 capture recalled-in-filer
15800 tap nxt
16200 tap nxt
17000 capture filer-halt-menu
17400 tap f1
18700 capture payload-recalled
19200 chord rshift two
20450 capture lib
20800 tap f1
22100 capture armtoolbox
22500 tap f1
22800 monitor
